    "text": "<p>Match List<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math> with List<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>II</mi></math></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>II</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(a)</td>\t\t\t<td>Chlorophyll</td>\t\t\t<td>(i)</td>\t\t\t<td>Ruthenium</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(b)</td>\t\t\t<td>Vitamin<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mn>12</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(ii)</td>\t\t\t<td>Platinum</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(c)</td>\t\t\t<td>Anticancer drug</td>\t\t\t<td>(iii)</td>\t\t\t<td>Cobalt</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(d)</td>\t\t\t<td>Grubbs catalyst</td>\t\t\t<td>(iv)</td>\t\t\t<td>Magnesium</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below:</p>",
